  (text "Commander touchpad module (rev P0) - the other sliding-tray module (TOUCHPAD_MODULE of the chassis model,\n131 x 68 mm: a 117.8 x 68 mm touch surface and a 13 mm strip for the electronics at the front end).\nA USB HID mouse / precision touchpad on its own USB-C.  The sensing is done by an Azoteq IQS550 (sheet tp_sensor);\nthe STC8H8K64U (the keyboard's chip) reads it over I2C and reports to the host.  Firmware is new - README.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b770e365-1ecb-5665-9428-942f071732c2"))
